|> Exercise
    handle=_evaluate_lambda_functions_

    Evaluate:

    |> Grid
        cols=2
        mobile-cols=1
        place-items=start
        with-padding=false
        column-first=true

        i. $(\lambda u.u^3)(0.5)$

        ii. $(u \ra u^2)(x + 1)$

        iii. $(\lambda t.t - 1)(100) \cdot (\lambda t.t + 1)(100)$

        iv. $(u \ra u^2)(a + b)$


    |> Solution

        The answers are:

        |> Grid
            cols=2
            mobile-cols=1
            place-items=start
            with-padding=false
            column-first=true

            i. $0.5^3 = 0.125$

            ii. $(x + 1)^2 = x^2 + 2x + 1$

            iii. $(100 - 1) \cdot (100 + 1) = 9999$

            iv. $(a + b)^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2$
